01:47:24.833 --> 01:47:28.583
- I hated rugby in
school. Did you know that?


01:47:31.417 --> 01:47:35.083
I was great at it, but
I hated every second.


01:47:39.667 --> 01:47:42.750
Never thought I'd
give it another go.


01:47:44.000 --> 01:47:46.250
